#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:1
msgid "Portfolio"
msgstr "组合"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:3
msgid "Positions, capacity, exposure and portfolio model inputs."
msgstr "持仓、容量、暴露以及组合模型输入。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:5
msgid ""
"See the [usage guide](../guides/portfolio-risk.md) for task-oriented "
"examples. Signatures below are generated from the public headers at the same"
" commit as the rest of this site."
msgstr "面向任务的示例参见[使用指南](../guides/portfolio-risk.md)。以下签名由与本站点其余内容同一提交的公共头文件生成。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid "Detached optional input tables for portfolio-domain workflows."
msgstr "组合领域工作流使用的独立可选输入表。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid ""
"Each supplied frame is owned by this object; materialize() returns another "
"independent copy. Only supplied fields are returned, under returns, "
"positions, transactions and benchmark_returns respectively. A supplied empty"
" frame is retained."
msgstr ""
"每个提供的帧由本对象持有；materialize() 返回另一份独立副本。只返回已提供的字段，分别位于 "
"returns、positions、transactions 与 benchmark_returns 之下。提供的空帧会被保留。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid "Public Functions"
msgstr "公共函数"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid "Constructs a container from optional input frames."
msgstr "由可选输入帧构造容器。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid "Returns an independent copy of each supplied input table."
msgstr "返回每张已提供输入表的独立副本。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:7
msgid ""
"Keys are added only for fields that were supplied; a supplied empty frame is"
" retained. Repeated calls produce independent frames."
msgstr "仅为已提供的字段添加键；提供的空帧会被保留。重复调用会产生彼此独立的帧。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md
