#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:10
msgid ""
"Days to liquidate per non-cash asset, indexed by position dates after the "
"rolling-volume warm-up."
msgstr "各非现金资产的清仓所需天数，索引为滚动成交量预热之后的持仓日期。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:10
msgid ""
"Maximum days to liquidate and allocation percentage per symbol, sorted by "
"symbol."
msgstr "各标的的最大清仓天数与配置百分比，按标的排序。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:10
msgid ""
"Maximum bar-consumption percentage per symbol in the scan window, sorted by "
"symbol."
msgstr "扫描窗口内各标的的最大 K 线消耗百分比，按标的排序。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:13
msgid "Parameters controlling assess_liquidity()."
msgstr "控制 assess_liquidity() 的参数。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:13
msgid ""
"Maximum fraction of a bar's dollar volume assumed executable per day; must "
"be in (0, 1]."
msgstr "每日假定可成交的单根 K 线金额占比上限；必须落在 (0, 1]。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:13
msgid ""
"Capital in currency units used to scale position allocations; must be "
"positive."
msgstr "用于缩放持仓配置的货币金额资本；必须为正。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:13
msgid ""
"Number of preceding bars in the rolling mean dollar volume; must be at least"
" 1."
msgstr "滚动平均成交额所用的前置 K 线数量；必须不小于 1。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:13
msgid "Optional trailing-day scan limit; when set, must be at least 1."
msgstr "可选的末尾天数扫描上限；设置时必须不小于 1。"

