msgstr "多头暴露值；单位由产生它的接口决定。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:19
msgid "Short exposure values; sign and units follow the producing API."
msgstr "空头暴露值；符号与单位由产生它的接口决定。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:19
msgid "Gross exposure values; units follow the producing API."
msgstr "总暴露值；单位由产生它的接口决定。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:19
msgid "Net exposure (long minus short); empty for APIs that do not populate it."
msgstr "净暴露（多头减空头）；未填充该值的接口为空。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:22
