msgstr "统计量名称，按输入顺序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:22
msgid "Statistic values over all round trips."
msgstr "全部完整交易的统计量值。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:22
msgid "Statistic values over long round trips; NaN when none exist."
msgstr "多头完整交易的统计量值；不存在时为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:22
msgid "Statistic values over short round trips; NaN when none exist."
msgstr "空头完整交易的统计量值；不存在时为 NaN。"

