#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:31
msgid "Labels for the value rows."
msgstr "数值行的标签。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:31
msgid "Labels for the value columns."
msgstr "数值列的标签。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:31
msgid "Row-major statistic values."
msgstr "行优先存储的统计量值。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:34
msgid "Named statistic applied by agg_all_long_short()."
msgstr "agg_all_long_short() 应用的命名统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:34
