#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Round-trip tables and per-symbol return statistics."
msgstr "完整交易表与各标的的收益统计。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid ""
"The first four tables contain rows for the non-empty All trades, short and "
"long groups in that order."
msgstr "前四个表按该顺序包含非空的 All trades、short 与 long 分组的行。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Profit/loss statistics."
msgstr "盈亏统计。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Trade counts and profitability."
msgstr "交易笔数与胜率。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Holding-duration statistics in days, plus trades per day and month."
msgstr "以天计的持仓时长统计，以及每日与每月交易数。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Round-trip return statistics."
msgstr "完整交易收益统计。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Symbols in ascending order."
msgstr "标的，按升序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "Fixed labels for the eight per-symbol return statistics."
msgstr "八项逐标的收益统计量的固定标签。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:37
msgid "One row per symbol statistic, one value per symbol in symbol_labels."
msgstr "每个标的统计量一行，symbol_labels 中每个标的对应一个值。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:40
msgid "Transaction record used to build round-trip inputs and closing trades."
msgstr "用于构造完整交易输入与平仓交易的交易记录。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:40
msgid "UTC nanosecond timestamp."
msgstr "UTC 纳秒时间戳。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:40
msgid "Signed quantity."
msgstr "带符号数量。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:40
msgid "Execution price per unit."
msgstr "单位成交价。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:43
msgid "Symbol-to-sector assignment used by get_sector_exposures()."
msgstr "get_sector_exposures() 使用的标的到行业指派。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:43
msgid "Output sector column name."
msgstr "输出行业列名。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:46
msgid "Numeric identifier and output label for an exposure bucket."
msgstr "暴露分桶的数值标识与输出标签。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:46
msgid "Numeric bucket identifier; sector exposures compare it with panel cells."
msgstr "分桶数值标识；行业暴露将其与面板单元格比较。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:46
msgid "Output column label."
msgstr "输出列标签。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:49
msgid "Per-symbol maximum liquidation time."
msgstr "各标的的最大清仓时间。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:49
msgid "Maximum days in the scan; NaN if none."
msgstr "扫描中的最大天数；无则为 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:49
msgid "Position allocation on that date as a percentage (100 * fraction)."
msgstr "该日期的持仓配置百分比（100 * fraction）。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:52
msgid "Ranked long, short and absolute position lists."
msgstr "排序后的多头、空头与绝对持仓列表。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:52
msgid "Largest positive column extrema, in descending order."
msgstr "最大的正向列极值，按降序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:52
msgid "Most negative column extrema, in ascending order."
msgstr "最负的列极值，按升序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:52
msgid "Largest absolute column extrema, in descending order."
msgstr "绝对值最大的列极值，按降序排列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:55
msgid "One trade used by the liquidity helpers."
msgstr "流动性辅助函数使用的一笔交易。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:55
msgid "Trade timestamp; bar helpers match it exactly."
msgstr "交易时间戳；K 线辅助函数按精确值匹配。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:55
msgid "Signed quantity; absolute value is used."
msgstr "带符号数量；使用其绝对值。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:58
msgid "Per-symbol worst transaction bar consumption."
msgstr "各标的最差的交易 K 线消耗。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:58
msgid "Date of maximum consumption."
msgstr "消耗量最大的日期。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:58
msgid "Traded amount as a percentage of bar volume."
msgstr "成交量占该 K 线成交量的百分比。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:61
msgid "Divisor convention used by get_turnover()."
msgstr "get_turnover() 使用的除数约定。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:61
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "取值："

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:61
msgid ""
"Average of the previous and current gross book, excluding cash; the first "
"row uses half of the current gross book."
msgstr "上一行与当前行总规模（不含现金）的平均值；第一行使用当前总规模的一半。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:61
msgid "Row sum of all numeric position columns, including cash."
msgstr "所有数值持仓列（含现金）的行和。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:64
msgid "Appends one closing transaction per still-open position."
msgstr "为每个仍未平掉的持仓追加一笔平仓交易。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:64
msgid ""
"The net amount per symbol is computed from transactions. For each non-cash "
"double column of positions with an absolute net amount of at least 1e-6, a "
"closing transaction is appended at the final position timestamp plus one "
"second. Its amount is the opposite of the net amount and its price is the "
"final position value divided by the net amount. Zero-amount transactions are"
" then removed from the combined result."
msgstr ""
"各标的的净金额由交易记录计算。对于持仓中绝对净金额不小于 1e-6 的每个非现金 double "
"列，在最后一个持仓时间戳加一秒处追加一笔平仓交易。其金额为净金额的相反数，其价格为最终持仓值除以净金额。随后从合并结果中移除金额为零的交易。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md
msgid "Throws"
msgstr "抛出"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:67
msgid "Adjusts daily returns for slippage on traded notional."
msgstr "按成交名义金额调整每日收益率以计入滑点。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:67
msgid ""
"Every UTC day in the sorted union of return, position and transaction days "
"is processed. A day with both a return and a portfolio value supplies pnl = "
"return * portfolio_value; a cost of traded notional * slippage_bps / 10000 "
"is subtracted from that PnL, and the day's return is rescaled by the "
"adjusted-to-original PnL ratio. Days without a usable return/PnL pair and "
"days with zero PnL yield 0.0."
msgstr ""
"对收益率、持仓与交易日期并集排序后的每个 UTC 日进行处理。同时具有收益率与组合价值的日期提供 pnl = return * "
"portfolio_value；从该损益中扣除 成交名义金额 * slippage_bps / 10000 "
"的成本，并按调整后与原始损益之比重新缩放当日收益率。没有可用收益率/损益配对的日子以及损益为零的日子得到 0.0。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:70
msgid "Applies caller-supplied statistics to all, long and short round trips."
msgstr "对全部、多头与空头完整交易应用调用方提供的统计量。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:70
msgid ""
"Each statistic is evaluated over every value of column in row order, then "
"over the subset selected by the required long boolean column. A statistic "
"whose subset is empty yields NaN for that subset."
msgstr "每个统计量先按行序作用于 column 的所有值，再作用于由必需的 long 布尔列选出的子集。子集为空的统计量在该子集上返回 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:73
msgid "Copies round trips and adds a sector column from symbol mappings."
msgstr "复制完整交易并依据标的映射添加行业列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:73
msgid ""
"The output keeps the input index, every double column, and every string "
"column except an existing sector; columns of other types are not copied. "
"When a string symbol column is present, a new sector column is appended "
"using sector_mappings; symbols absent from the map get an empty string. "
"Without a symbol column no sector column is added."
msgstr ""
"输出保留输入索引、所有 double 列，以及除已有 sector 之外的所有字符串列；其他类型的列不会被复制。存在字符串类型的 symbol "
"列时，使用 sector_mappings 追加一个新的 sector 列；映射中不存在的标的得到空字符串。没有 symbol 列时不会添加行业列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:76
msgid "Applies a quadratic market-impact penalty to daily returns."
msgstr "对每日收益率应用二次市场冲击惩罚。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:76
msgid ""
"Trades are rescaled from backtest to simulation capital by "
"simulate_starting_capital / backtest_starting_capital. For each trade, "
"shares = |scaled amount|, dollars = price * shares and the penalty is "
"(shares / volume)^2 * impact * dollars; penalties are summed by UTC day. "
"Return days are compounded into wealth, and each daily penalty is divided by"
" the simulated portfolio value and subtracted from that day's return."
msgstr ""
"交易按 simulate_starting_capital / backtest_starting_capital "
"从回测资本缩放为模拟资本。对每笔交易，shares = |scaled amount|，dollars = price * shares，惩罚为 "
"(shares / volume)^2 * impact * dollars；惩罚按 UTC "
"日汇总。收益日复合为财富，每日惩罚除以模拟组合价值后从当日收益中扣除。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:79
msgid "Assesses position and transaction liquidity."
msgstr "评估持仓与交易流动性。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:79
msgid ""
"Combines days_to_liquidate_positions(), "
"get_max_days_to_liquidate_by_ticker() and get_low_liquidity_transactions() "
"using one validated configuration."
msgstr ""
"使用同一份已校验配置组合 "
"days_to_liquidate_positions()、get_max_days_to_liquidate_by_ticker() 与 "
"get_low_liquidity_transactions()。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:82
msgid "Returns market-cap bucket exposure fractions."
msgstr "返回市值分桶的暴露比例。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:82
msgid ""
"Buckets use inclusive bounds in the units of the caps panel: Micro covers "
"50M-300M, Small 300M-2B, Mid 2B-10B, Large 10B-200B and Mega 200B and above."
" Values below 50M match no bucket, and a value on a shared boundary can "
"match adjacent buckets. Exposure fractions are computed as in "
"compute_sector_exposures()."
msgstr ""
"分桶使用市值面板单位下的闭区间：Micro 覆盖 50M-300M，Small 300M-2B，Mid 2B-10B，Large 10B-"
"200B，Mega 为 200B 及以上。低于 50M 的值不匹配任何分桶，落在共享边界上的值可同时匹配相邻分桶。暴露比例的计算方式与 "
"compute_sector_exposures() 相同。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:85
msgid "Returns sector long, short, gross and net exposure fractions."
msgstr "返回行业的多头、空头、总暴露与净暴露比例。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:85
msgid ""
"Assets are matched to definitions by comparing each sectors cell with "
"sector_definition::id. For each row the bundle reports the sector's share of"
" total long, total short (as a negative fraction) and total gross non-cash "
"positions; net exposure is long minus short. A sector without matched "
"positions contributes zero."
msgstr ""
"通过将 sectors 的每个单元格与 sector_definition::id "
"比较来把资产匹配到定义。对每一行，结果包报告该行业占非现金持仓的多头总额、空头总额（以负比例表示）与总敞口总额的比例；净暴露为多头减空头。没有匹配持仓的行业贡献为零。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:88
msgid "Returns the weighted style-factor exposure per timestamp."
msgstr "返回各时间戳的加权风格因子暴露。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:88
msgid ""
"For each row the exposure is sum(position * factor) / sum(|position|) over "
"non-cash asset columns. NaN positions are skipped entirely; a NaN factor "
"contributes zero to the numerator while its position still counts in the "
"denominator. A zero denominator or non-finite result yields 0.0."
msgstr ""
"对每一行，暴露为非现金资产列上的 sum(position * factor) / sum(|position|)。NaN 持仓完全跳过；NaN "
"因子对分子贡献为零，但其持仓仍计入分母。分母为零或结果非有限时得到 0.0。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:91
msgid "Returns position-to-volume exposure percentages."
msgstr "返回持仓与成交量的暴露百分比。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:91
msgid ""
"For each row and common share/volume column, shares / volume is computed. "
"Positive shares feed the long set, negative shares feed the short set as "
"positive magnitudes, and absolute fractions feed the gross set. The reported"
" value is 100 times the linearly interpolated quantile at percentile of each"
" set, or 0.0 when the set is empty. Only common columns contribute to the "
"quantiles; a nonzero share value in any share column requires a finite, "
"positive matching volume."
msgstr ""
"对每一行以及共有的股份/成交量列计算 shares / "
"volume。正股份计入多头集合，负股份以正幅值计入空头集合，绝对比例计入总敞口集合。报告值为各集合在 percentile 处线性插值分位数的 100"
" 倍；集合为空时为 0.0。只有共有列参与分位数计算；任一股份列中的非零股份值都要求存在有限且为正 matching volume。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:94
msgid "Returns daily aggregated trade bars joined to price and volume panels."
msgstr "返回与价格和成交量面板连接的按日聚合交易 K 线。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:94
msgid ""
"Trades are summed by exact (symbol, date) using absolute amounts; dates are "
"not normalized. Each transaction date must exist in the price index, and "
"each traded symbol must have both price and volume columns. The result is "
"sorted by symbol and then date."
msgstr ""
"交易按精确的 (symbol, date) "
"以绝对金额汇总；日期不做归一化。每个交易日期都必须存在于价格索引中，且每个成交标的都必须同时具有价格列与成交量列。结果先按标的、再按日期排序。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:97
msgid "Returns days needed to liquidate each position asset."
msgstr "返回清仓各持仓资产所需的天数。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:97
msgid ""
"Position allocations use the row total of all double columns. Daily dollar "
"volume is the mean of price * volume over the preceding mean_volume_window "
"bars, so the first window rows are warm-up and are omitted. Each value is "
"allocation * capital_base / (max_bar_consumption * mean dollar volume); a "
"NaN or zero mean dollar volume yields NaN for that row. The named cash "
"column is excluded when present but is not required."
msgstr ""
"持仓配置使用所有 double 列的行和。日成交额为前置 mean_volume_window 根 K 线上 price * volume "
"的均值，因此窗口内的前若干行属于预热并被省略。每个值为 allocation * capital_base / (max_bar_consumption"
" * 平均成交额)；平均成交额为 NaN 或零时该行返回 NaN。指定的现金列存在时被排除，但并非必需。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:100
msgid "Extracts FIFO round trips from transaction rows."
msgstr "从交易行中提取先进先出完整交易。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:100
msgid ""
"Transactions are first consolidated as in "
"groupby_consecutive_transactions(). Each block is matched first-in, first-"
"out against open lots of the opposite direction; a block may both close "
"existing lots and open a remainder. Blocks with a negative price are "
"skipped. The output index is the sequential round-trip number starting at 0."
msgstr ""
"先按 groupby_consecutive_transactions() "
"的方式合并交易。每个块以先进先出方式与反向的未平仓批次匹配；一个块既可能平掉已有批次，也可能留下新的剩余持仓。价格为负的块会被跳过。输出索引为从 0 "
"开始递增的完整交易序号。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:100
msgid ""
"Output columns are pnl, open_dt, close_dt, long, rt_returns, symbol and "
"duration (elapsed nanoseconds stored as a timestamp). long is true for a "
"round trip closed by a sell; rt_returns is pnl divided by matched opening "
"notional, or 0 when that notional is zero."
msgstr ""
"输出列为 pnl、open_dt、close_dt、long、rt_returns、symbol 与 "
"duration（以时间戳存储的经过纳秒数）。由卖出平仓的完整交易其 long 为 true；rt_returns 为 pnl "
"除以匹配的开仓名义金额，该名义金额为零时取 0。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:103
msgid "Computes round-trip performance tables and per-symbol statistics."
msgstr "计算完整交易业绩表与逐标的统计。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:103
msgid ""
"Durations are derived as close - open in days. Each table contains rows for "
"the non-empty All trades, short and long groups in that order, with fixed "
"English column labels. Per-symbol values use the statistics listed in "
"symbol_stat_labels, one column per symbol. An empty frame yields default-"
"constructed, empty statistics."
msgstr ""
"持仓时长按 close - open 以天计算。每个表按该顺序包含非空的 All trades、short 与 long "
"分组的行，列标签为固定英文。逐标的值使用 symbol_stat_labels 列出的统计量，每个标的一列。空帧产生默认构造的空统计。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:106
msgid "Returns per-timestamp long and short notional values."
msgstr "返回各时间戳的多头与空头名义金额。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:106
msgid ""
"Each row sums positive non-cash position values into the first vector and "
"absolute negative values into the second. NaN cells are skipped. The named "
"cash column is excluded when present but is not required."
msgstr "每一行把正的非现金持仓值累加到第一个向量，把负值的绝对值累加到第二个向量。跳过 NaN 单元格。指定的现金列存在时被排除，但并非必需。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:109
msgid "Returns gross long and short position values per timestamp."
msgstr "返回各时间戳的多头与空头持仓总额。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:109
msgid ""
"Positive non-cash position values are summed into long and negative values "
"are summed into short as positive magnitudes. NaN cells are skipped. The "
"named cash column is excluded when present but is not required."
msgstr "正的非现金持仓值累加为多头，负值以正幅值累加为空头。跳过 NaN 单元格。指定的现金列存在时被排除，但并非必需。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:112
msgid "Returns the worst bar consumption per symbol for recent trades."
msgstr "返回近期交易中各标的最差的 K 线消耗。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:112
msgid ""
"Trades are summed by exact (symbol, date) using absolute amounts. When "
"last_n_days is set, only dates strictly after newest - last_n_days days are "
"scanned, where newest is the latest trade date. For each symbol the date "
"with the largest amount / volume * 100 is retained, and results are sorted "
"by symbol."
msgstr ""
"交易按精确的 (symbol, date) 以绝对金额汇总。设置 last_n_days 时，仅扫描严格晚于 newest - last_n_days "
"天的日期，其中 newest 为最新交易日期。对每个标的保留 amount / volume * 100 最大的日期，结果按标的排序。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:115
msgid "Returns the maximum liquidation time per position symbol."
msgstr "返回各持仓标的的最大清仓时间。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:115
msgid ""
"Uses days_to_liquidate_positions() with the supplied parameters. When "
"last_n_days is set, only metric rows at or after newest - last_n_days days "
"are considered. Each record reports the maximum days value and the position "
"allocation on that date as a percentage (100 * fraction). Symbols with no "
"valid value keep NaN fields. Results are sorted by symbol."
msgstr ""
"使用给定参数调用 days_to_liquidate_positions()。设置 last_n_days 时，只考虑不早于 newest - "
"last_n_days 天的指标行。每条记录报告最大天数值，以及该日期以百分比表示的持仓配置（100 * fraction）。没有有效值的标的其字段保持"
" NaN。结果按标的排序。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:118
msgid "Returns row-wise long and short position concentration measures."
msgstr "返回按行的多头与空头持仓集中度度量。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:118
msgid ""
"Allocation fractions are computed as in get_percent_alloc() over all double "
"columns. For each row, max_long is the largest positive non-cash allocation,"
" median_long the median positive allocation, median_short the median "
"negative allocation and max_short the most negative allocation. A side "
"without allocations yields NaN."
msgstr ""
"配置比例按 get_percent_alloc() 的方式在所有 double 列上计算。对每一行，max_long "
"为最大的正非现金配置，median_long 为正配置的中位数，median_short 为负配置的中位数，max_short "
"为最负的配置。没有配置的一侧返回 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:121
msgid "Returns each numeric position column as a fraction of its row total."
msgstr "将每个数值持仓列返回为其行和的比例。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:121
msgid ""
"The output has the same index and one double column per input double column,"
" in input order. NaN cells are excluded from the row total and remain NaN in"
" the output; a zero row total yields NaN. Values are fractions, not "
"percentages."
msgstr ""
"输出具有相同索引，并按输入顺序为每个输入 double 列生成一个 double 列。NaN 单元格不计入行和在输出中仍为 NaN；行和为零时返回 "
"NaN。取值为比例而非百分比。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:124
msgid "Returns raw sector exposures by summing assigned positions."
msgstr "通过汇总指派的持仓返回原始行业暴露。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:124
msgid ""
"One column is produced per sector named in assignments, in lexicographic "
"sector order, followed by the cash column copied from positions. Only "
"assignments whose symbol names an existing non-cash double column "
"contribute; unassigned assets are omitted. Values are summed raw positions, "
"not fractions."
msgstr ""
"按 assignments 中命名的每个行业生成一列，按行业的字典序排列，随后是从持仓复制的现金列。只有标的名称对应已有非现金 double "
"列的指派才参与；未指派的资产被忽略。取值为原始持仓之和，而不是比例。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:127
msgid "Returns the top long, short and absolute positions by symbol."
msgstr "返回按标的排序的最大多头、空头与绝对持仓。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:127
msgid ""
"Each non-cash double column contributes its maximum value to the long list "
"when positive, its minimum value to the short list when negative, and its "
"maximum absolute value to the absolute list. Lists are sorted by value "
"(longs and absolutes descending, shorts ascending) and truncated to top "
"entries. NaN rows are ignored; symbols without a qualifying value are "
"omitted."
msgstr ""
"每个非现金 double "
"列在其最大值为正时计入多头列表，其最小值为负时计入空头列表，其绝对值最大者计入绝对值列表。列表按值排序（多头与绝对值降序，空头升序）并截断为前 top "
"项。忽略 NaN 行；没有合格值的标的被省略。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:130
msgid "Returns daily turnover using the selected denominator."
msgstr "使用选定分母返回每日换手率。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:130
msgid ""
"The output index is the sorted union of position days and transaction days, "
"both normalized to UTC midnight. Transaction notional comes from "
"get_txn_vol(), and position days must be strictly increasing and unique. "
"actual_gross_book divides by the average of the previous and current gross "
"book (excluding cash), using half the current gross book on the first row. "
"portfolio_value divides by the row sum of all double position columns, "
"including cash. Non-finite ratios are returned as 0.0, and values are ratios"
" rather than percentages."
msgstr ""
"输出索引为持仓日与交易日并集的排序结果，两者都归一化到 UTC 零点。交易名义金额来自 "
"get_txn_vol()，持仓日期必须严格递增且唯一。actual_gross_book "
"除以上一行与当前行总规模（不含现金）的平均值，第一行使用当前总规模的一半。portfolio_value 除以所有 double "
"持仓列（含现金）的行和。非有限的比例返回 0.0，且取值为比例而非百分比。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:133
msgid "Returns daily transaction notional and share totals."
msgstr "返回每日交易名义金额与股份总量。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:133
msgid ""
"Rows are grouped by UTC calendar day, normalized to midnight and sorted "
"ascending. txn_volume sums |amount| * price and txn_shares sums |amount|; "
"contributions that evaluate to NaN are skipped, and infinite values are "
"preserved."
msgstr ""
"行按 UTC 日历日分组，归一化到零点并升序排序。txn_volume 汇总 |amount| * price，txn_shares 汇总 "
"|amount|；计算结果为 NaN 的贡献被跳过，无穷值得到保留。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:136
msgid "Returns gross leverage per timestamp."
msgstr "返回各时间戳的总杠杆。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:136
msgid ""
"Gross leverage is the sum of absolute non-cash position values divided by "
"the row total of all double columns, including cash. NaN cells are skipped; "
"a zero denominator or a non-finite ratio yields NaN."
msgstr "总杠杆为非现金持仓值绝对值之和除以所有 double 列（含现金）的行和。跳过 NaN 单元格；分母为零或比例非有限时返回 NaN。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:139
msgid "Groups consecutive same-direction transactions into price/amount blocks."
msgstr "将连续同向交易分组成价格/金额块。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:139
msgid ""
"Rows are ordered by symbol, timestamp and original position, then adjacent "
"rows of the same symbol with amounts both positive or both non-positive are "
"merged while the gap to the previous row does not exceed max_delta. A "
"block's amount is the sum of its amounts, its price is the amount-weighted "
"average price, and its timestamp is the first row's timestamp. A negative "
"max_delta disables merging."
msgstr ""
"行按标的、时间戳与原始位置排序，随后对同一标的相邻且金额同为正或同为非正的行进行合并，直到与前一行的间隔超过 max_delta "
"为止。块的金额为其金额之和，其价格为金额加权平均价，其时间戳为首行的时间戳。max_delta 为负时禁用合并。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:142
msgid "Builds an owning transaction frame from validated transactions."
msgstr "由已校验的交易构造带所有权的交易帧。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:142
msgid ""
"Each input is validated with map_transaction(). The frame index holds the "
"transaction dates; columns are the string symbol and the double amount and "
"price columns. Input order and duplicate dates are preserved."
msgstr ""
"每个输入都用 map_transaction() 校验。帧索引保存交易日期；列为字符串 symbol 以及 double 的 amount 与 "
"price 列。保留输入顺序与重复日期。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:145
msgid "Validates and returns a copy of a portfolio transaction."
msgstr "校验组合交易并返回其副本。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:145
msgid ""
"A valid transaction has a non-empty symbol and finite amount and price; "
"other fields are copied unchanged."
msgstr "有效交易须具有非空 symbol 以及有限的 amount 与 price；其他字段原样复制。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:148
msgid "Returns positions in long form, one record per row and non-cash column."
msgstr "以长表形式返回持仓，每行每个非现金列一条记录。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:148
msgid ""
"Records follow input row order and then input column order. NaN values are "
"retained, and the named cash column is excluded when present. The "
"pos_in_dollars flag is accepted for API compatibility but does not transform"
" values in this implementation."
msgstr ""
"记录先按输入行顺序、再按输入列顺序排列。保留 NaN 值，指定的现金列存在时被排除。pos_in_dollars "
"标志为接口兼容性而接受，但本实现不据此转换数值。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:151
msgid "Default name of the cash column in wide position frames."
msgstr "宽表持仓帧中现金列的默认名称。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:154
msgid "Default maximum gap (8 hours) between transactions merged into one block."
msgstr "合并为同一块的相邻交易之间允许的最大间隔（8 小时）。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:157
msgid "Round-trip closing timestamp column."
msgstr "完整交易的平仓时间戳列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:160
msgid "Round-trip elapsed-nanoseconds column, stored as a timestamp."
msgstr "完整交易的经过纳序列，以时间戳存储。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:163
msgid "Round-trip long/short flag column."
msgstr "完整交易的多头/空头标志列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:166
msgid "Round-trip opening timestamp column."
msgstr "完整交易的开仓时间戳列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:169
msgid "Round-trip profit/loss column."
msgstr "完整交易的盈亏列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:172
msgid "Round-trip return column."
msgstr "完整交易的收益列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:175
msgid "Default signed-quantity column in transaction frames."
msgstr "交易帧中带符号数量列的默认名称。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:178
msgid "Default bar share-volume column used by apply_slippage_penalty()."
msgstr "apply_slippage_penalty() 使用的默认 K 线股份成交量列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:181
msgid "Default execution-price column in transaction frames."
msgstr "交易帧中成交价的默认列。"

#: ../../site/api/portfolio.md:184
msgid "Default symbol column name in transaction and round-trip frames."
msgstr "交易帧与完整交易帧中 symbol 列的默认名称。"

#~ msgid "Default maximum gap between transactions merged into one block."
#~ msgstr ""

